solution:
As usual, let $a = BC,$ $b = AC,$ and $c = AB.$

[asy]
unitsize(0.8 cm);

pair A, B, C, D, E, F;

A = (0,0);
B = (8,0);
C = 3*dir(120);
D = extension(A, incenter(A,B,C), B, C);
E = extension(B, incenter(A,B,C), C, A);
F = extension(C, incenter(A,B,C), A, B);

draw(A--B--C--cycle);
draw(A--D);
draw(B--E);
draw(C--F);
draw(E--D--F);

label("$A$", A, SW);
label("$B$", B, SE);
label("$C$", C, NW);
label("$D$", D, N);
